"segments": [
{
"start": 0.0,
"end": 2.0,
"text": "Hi Ron, how's it going?",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 2.0,
"end": 4.0,
"text": "I'm good.",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 4.0,
"end": 6.0,
"text": "Sir, you seem to be good.",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 6.0,
"end": 8.0,
"text": "Yeah, I know. I've got to check the street.",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 8.0,
"end": 10.0,
"text": "There's another one here.",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 12.0,
"end": 14.0,
"text": "Sometimes it's worth a turn, right?",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 14.0,
"end": 16.0,
"text": "This time particularly went the wrong way.",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 16.0,
"end": 18.0,
"text": "I'm going to have to definitely go over it.",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 18.0,
"end": 25.0,
"text": "With regard to this specialty, I think I've got most of the information.",
"conf": -0.5,
"no_speech": 0.14
},
{
"start": 25.0,
"end": 27.0,
"text": "I didn't coin it over.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 27.0,
"end": 30.0,
"text": "I'm not going to go into such a deal.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 30.0,
"end": 34.0,
"text": "I don't have any suggestions on knocking on the block,",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 34.0,
"end": 36.0,
"text": "getting a tail room, or something.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 36.0,
"end": 38.0,
"text": "It's just a fun idea.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 38.0,
"end": 40.0,
"text": "But when you talk about hiding from the White House,",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 40.0,
"end": 42.0,
"text": "I'm not going to go into any of that.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 42.0,
"end": 44.0,
"text": "It's been supposedly long.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 44.0,
"end": 46.0,
"text": "I'm not going to go into that.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 46.0,
"end": 48.0,
"text": "But I'm not hiding from the White House.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 48.0,
"end": 50.0,
"text": "I spoke with him 50 states.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 50.0,
"end": 52.0,
"text": "We're great at using this game.",
"conf": -0.67,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 52.0,
"end": 59.0,
"text": "I've discussed those issues, which is by the way we've heard, do not have foreign issues.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.63
},
{
"start": 59.0,
"end": 66.0,
"text": "Well, I tend to agree with you because part of the reason I think it is basic is that I think it becomes totally offensive.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.63
},
{
"start": 66.0,
"end": 76.0,
"text": "Well, I don't mean too much, but technically the reports that I've heard in the last 24 hours suggest that this particular chapter is causing some concern, which is untrue, of course.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.63
},
{
"start": 76.0,
"end": 77.8,
"text": "So, somebody said that, right.",
"conf": -0.52,
"no_speech": 0.59
},
{
"start": 78.0,
"end": 87.4,
"text": "Now, I thought, yeah, if you're a political champion, you can remove that by simply having it very quickly.",
"conf": -0.52,
"no_speech": 0.59
},
{
"start": 87.9,
"end": 94.4,
"text": "One way to do it is either actually get about a third, five-second response every day.",
"conf": -0.52,
"no_speech": 0.59
},
{
"start": 95.0,
"end": 98.4,
"text": "Now, maybe once it's possible or hard to do, first I think it's possible.",
"conf": -0.52,
"no_speech": 0.59
},
{
"start": 99.2,
"end": 103.1,
"text": "I think you would just say, don't say, oh, John Stanton, the guy who's responsible for this,",
"conf": -0.52,
"no_speech": 0.59
},
{
"start": 103.1,
"end": 105.4,
"text": "the president, the prime minister, the session, that's what I'm feeling.",
"conf": -0.52,
"no_speech": 0.59
},
{
"start": 105.4,
"end": 107.4,
"text": "I think they're good.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 107.4,
"end": 111.4,
"text": "To the extent that I do these specials, they're good.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 111.4,
"end": 113.4,
"text": "Very good.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 113.4,
"end": 115.4,
"text": "Is there a...",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 115.4,
"end": 118.4,
"text": "I don't think you even have to say that because they have carried the case.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 118.4,
"end": 122.4,
"text": "I will, I will if you do not relax your mind.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 122.4,
"end": 125.4,
"text": "I will relax my mind.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 125.4,
"end": 127.4,
"text": "This is a way to come on.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 127.4,
"end": 129.4,
"text": "...",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 129.4,
"end": 131.4,
"text": "Yeah, I agree.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 131.4,
"end": 133.4,
"text": "Very open on it.",
"conf": -0.64,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 133.4,
"end": 134.2,
"text": "that I could",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.41
},
{
"start": 134.2,
"end": 137.6,
"text": "but I",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.41
},
{
