"text": "worry about that",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.41
},
{
"start": 163.0,
"end": 167.0,
"text": "they can't make it work with the state of the field, with the party economy, with the political economy,",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 167.0,
"end": 171.0,
"text": "and so forth, and work it out, but there's speculation to let the government do it.",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 171.0,
"end": 175.0,
"text": "But, the background of the economy, obviously we can't respond to it,",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 175.0,
"end": 179.0,
"text": "but on the economy, for a new standpoint,",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 179.0,
"end": 183.0,
"text": "of substance use,",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 183.0,
"end": 187.0,
"text": "they will be looking, you might say,",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 187.0,
"end": 191.0,
"text": "they will be looking for any indication",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 191.0,
"end": 195.0,
"text": "of hope on one side, of pessimism on the other side.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 195.0,
"end": 199.0,
"text": "But I think it would be, just, yes sir,",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 199.0,
"end": 203.0,
"text": "because I think it's popular to focus on that.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 203.0,
"end": 207.0,
"text": "That's right.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 207.0,
"end": 211.0,
"text": "So, let's go",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 211.0,
"end": 215.0,
"text": "get into some of the discussions that we've had the entire time.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 215.0,
"end": 219.0,
"text": "We've had the Jews, we've had the Jews back.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 219.0,
"end": 221.0,
"text": "And here again that's been covered up.",
"conf": -0.4,
"no_speech": 0.28
},
