},
{
"start": 247.0,
"end": 254.0,
"text": "We have not made a commitment ourselves either way.",
"conf": -0.48,
"no_speech": 0.8
},
{
"start": 254.0,
"end": 260.0,
"text": "As a matter of fact, they understand the President's perspective.",
"conf": -0.48,
"no_speech": 0.8
},
{
"start": 260.0,
"end": 262.0,
"text": "They all say they understand it.",
"conf": -0.48,
"no_speech": 0.8
},
{
"start": 262.0,
"end": 267.0,
"text": "Therefore, I would say, gentlemen, our position is to stay down on how we intend to protest",
"conf": -0.48,
"no_speech": 0.8
},
{
"start": 267.0,
"end": 269.0,
"text": "and it would be appropriate for me to say it.",
"conf": -0.48,
"no_speech": 0.8
},
{
"start": 269.0,
"end": 274.0,
"text": "Because if you admit on the ribbon call today that that is true,",
"conf": -0.48,
"no_speech": 0.8
},
{
"start": 274.0,
"end": 282.8,
"text": "and then he asked me a question, and I said, yeah, so he said, you said, you're going to do anything that's going to make the machine do it.",
"conf": -0.69,
"no_speech": 0.75
},
{
"start": 282.8,
"end": 285.7,
"text": "And I said, the question is, who does that work for?",
"conf": -0.69,
"no_speech": 0.75
},
{
"start": 285.7,
"end": 290.8,
"text": "And he said, who does that work for?",
"conf": -0.69,
"no_speech": 0.75
},
{
"start": 290.8,
"end": 294.0,
"text": "And I said, who does that work for?",
"conf": -0.69,
"no_speech": 0.75
},
{
"start": 294.0,
"end": 295.0,
"text": "And he said, who does that work for?",
"conf": -0.69,
"no_speech": 0.75
},
{
"start": 295.0,
"end": 297.0,
"text": "So what's happening now is that the factory is making the machine do it.",
"conf": -0.69,
"no_speech": 0.75
},
{
"start": 297.0,
"end": 301.0,
"text": "And I said, yeah, this is for a very long time.",
"conf": -0.69,
"no_speech": 0.75
},
{
"start": 301.0,
"end": 303.0,
"text": "I don't want to say that, because you have to put it in history.",
"conf": -0.69,
"no_speech": 0.75
},
{
"start": 303.0,
"end": 306.0,
"text": "I'm against it, but you don't know what you ought to do.",
"conf": -0.41,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 306.0,
"end": 309.0,
"text": "No, I don't think we should position ourselves on it.",
"conf": -0.41,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 309.0,
"end": 312.0,
"text": "I mean, by what you've said up to this point,",
"conf": -0.41,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 312.0,
"end": 315.0,
"text": "it is clear to me that you're against it.",
"conf": -0.41,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 318.0,
"end": 320.0,
"text": "Everybody knows that.",
"conf": -0.41,
"no_speech": 0.62
},
{
"start": 320.0,
"end": 335.3,
"text": "I also hear it from the state around me that it's such a great deal, and we look up to",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.56
},
{
"start": 335.3,
"end": 339.2,
"text": "them, and they dance with it, and I'm very, very blessed.",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.56
},
{
"start": 339.8,
"end": 345.0,
"text": "I always did this, and while I was in the reception room, somebody went and did this",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.56
},
{
"start": 345.0,
"end": 349.6,
"text": "and that, and I can see that people say, you know, it's a hell of a deal.",
"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.56
},
{
"start": 350.0,
"end": 360.0,
"text": "...",
