"no_speech": 0.81
},
{
"start": 378.0,
"end": 383.0,
"text": "The point to take there is, generally from the outset, we've been addressing all of the field governors.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 383.0,
"end": 386.0,
"text": "You know, they're welcome. We're trying to get them into the balance.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 386.0,
"end": 392.0,
"text": "So we're working in our efforts to do negotiations and achieve a relationship with the field governors.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 392.0,
"end": 395.0,
"text": "That's where the push comes from.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 395.0,
"end": 399.0,
"text": "How about the 3.3 vote?",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 399.0,
"end": 404.0,
"text": "I don't know the aim of anybody getting into that because it's wrong, which they're not.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.55
},
{
"start": 404.0,
"end": 407.0,
"text": "Elias got some good press here today, so what are we going to do?",
"conf": -0.56,
"no_speech": 0.19
},
{
"start": 407.0,
"end": 411.0,
"text": "Elias got some good press here today, so what are we going to do?",
"conf": -0.56,
"no_speech": 0.19
},
{
"start": 411.0,
"end": 414.0,
"text": "I just think he didn't figure out what he was going to do.",
"conf": -0.56,
"no_speech": 0.19
},
{
"start": 414.0,
"end": 419.0,
"text": "We're into our efforts to get to that.",
"conf": -0.56,
"no_speech": 0.19
},
{
"start": 419.0,
"end": 426.0,
"text": "Well, Mr. President, I'd say we prefer that we don't deal with them.",
"conf": -0.56,
"no_speech": 0.19
},
{
"start": 426.0,
"end": 430.0,
"text": "I don't know if you have any more groups you want to connect with?",
"conf": -0.75,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 430.0,
"end": 436.0,
"text": "Actually, I think, you know, there is a lot of people saying that you're the best one,",
"conf": -0.75,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 436.0,
"end": 438.0,
"text": "you're the greatest one.",
"conf": -0.75,
"no_speech": 0.57
},
{
"start": 438.0,
"end": 441.0,
"text": "I don't know if you wish that you were the best one, I guess.",
